</span></a><a href="https://github.com/epoch-research" aria-label="GitHub" data-astro-cid-knz2wypv><span class="icon x-icon "><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M10 0C8.68678 0 7.38642 0.258658 6.17317 0.761205C4.95991 1.26375 3.85752 2.00035 2.92893 2.92893C1.05357 4.8043 0 7.34783 0 10C0 14.42 2.87 18.17 6.84 19.5C7.34 19.58 7.5 19.27 7.5 19V17.31C4.73 17.91 4.14 15.97 4.14 15.97C3.68 14.81 3.03 14.5 3.03 14.5C2.12 13.88 3.1 13.9 3.1 13.9C4.1 13.97 4.63 14.93 4.63 14.93C5.5 16.45 6.97 16 7.54 15.76C7.63 15.11 7.89 14.67 8.17 14.42C5.95 14.17 3.62 13.31 3.62 9.5C3.62 8.39 4 7.5 4.65 6.79C4.55 6.54 4.2 5.5 4.75 4.15C4.75 4.15 5.59 3.88 7.5 5.17C8.29 4.95 9.15 4.84 10 4.84C10.85 4.84 11.71 4.95 12.5 5.17C14.41 3.88 15.25 4.15 15.25 4.15C15.8 5.5 15.45 6.54 15.35 6.79C16 7.5 16.38 8.39 16.38 9.5C16.38 13.32 14.04 14.16 11.81 14.41C12.17 14.72 12.5 15.33 12.5 16.26V19C12.5 19.27 12.66 19.59 13.17 19.5C17.14 18.16 20 14.42 20 10C20 8.68678 19.7413 7.38642 19.2388 6.17316C18.7363 4.95991 17.9997 3.85752 17.0711 2.92893C16.1425 2.00035 15.0401 1.26375 13.8268 0.761205C12.6136 0.258658 11.3132 0 10 0Z" fill="currentColor"/>
